From 6fbd8f4b40c814f1855e52fddc56e2c23e3eccb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zheng Yejian <zhengyejian1@huawei.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Sep 2022 20:18:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0505/1076] [Huawei] livepatch: Organize active functions with
 struct 'list_head'

Offering: HULK
hulk inclusion
category: bugfix
bugzilla: 187321

--------------------------------

Struct 'klp_func_list' is used to organize active functions with
unidirectional linked list, it is too complicated.

Here rename it as 'actv_func', and organize with 'list_head' to
make it clear.

Signed-off-by: Zheng Yejian <zhengyejian1@huawei.com>
